a-content=\"offense\"><h4>Offense</h4><hr /><strong>Speed</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"speed\">  <li>Land 40 ft</li>  <li>Swim 20 ft</li>  <li>Climb 20 ft</li>  </ul><br />  <strong>Melee</strong> bite +1 (1d4 plus disease)<br />   <ul class=\"sbcSemicolonList\">   </ul>   <strong>Special Attacks</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"special-attacks\">  <li>disease</li>  </ul><br />  </div></div>    <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"statistics\"><h4>Statistics</h4><hr /><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"attributes\"><li><strong>Str</strong> 10</li><li><strong>Dex</strong> 17</li><li><strong>Con</strong> 13</li><li><strong>Int</strong> 2</li><li><strong>Wis</strong> 13</li><li><strong>Cha</strong> 4</li></ul><br /><ul class=\"sbcSemicolonList\" data-content=\"base-attack\"><li><strong>Base Atk</strong>+0</li><li><strong>CMB</strong> -1</li><li><strong>CMD</strong> 12  (16 vs. trip) </li></ul><br />  <strong>Feats</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"feats\">  <li>Skill Focus <ul class=\"sbcCommaList sbcParensWrappedList\">  <li>Perception</li>  </ul></li>  </ul><br />   <strong>Skills</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"skills\">  <li>Climb +11</li>  <li>Perception +4</li>  <li>Stealth +11</li>  <li>Swim +11</li>  </ul>  <br />     </div>  <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"ecology\"><h4>Ecology</h4><hr />  <strong>Environment</strong>   any urban <br />   <strong>Organization</strong>  solitary or pack (2-20)<br />   <strong>Treasure</strong>  none   <br />  </div>    <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"special-abilities\"><h4> Special Abilities </h4><hr />  <p><strong>Disease (Ex)</strong> Filth fever: Bite-injury; save Fort DC 11; onset 1d3 days; frequency 1/day; effect 1d3 Dex damage and 1d3 Con damage; cure 2 consecutive saves. The save DC is Constitution-based.    </p>  </div>    <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"description\"><h4> Description </h4><hr /><div class=\"sbcPreWrap\">\nDire rats grow up to 2 feet long and weigh up to 25 pounds. They are common menaces in dungeons and city sewers alike.\n\nDire Rat Companions Starting Statistics: Size Small; Speed 40 ft., climb 20 ft., swim 20 ft.; Attack bite (1d4); Ability Scores Str 10, Dex 17, Con 12, Int 2, Wis 12, Cha 4; Special Qualities lowlight vision, scent.\n\n4th-Level Advancement: Attack bite (1d4 plus disease); Ability Scores Str +2, Con +2.\n</div></div>  </div><hr class=\"sbcBorder\" /></div><p></p></div><br /><hr /><div class=\"rawInputContainer\" style=\"margin-top:15px\"><h2 style=\"text-align:middle;border:none;text-transform:uppercase;color:#000\">RAW INPUT</h2><hr /><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:14px\">    Dire Rat (CR 0.33)\nSource PFRPG Bestiary \nCR 1/3 \nXP 135 \nN Small animal  \nInit +3; Senses low-light vision, scent; Perception +4   \nDefense   \nAC 14, touch 14, flat-footed 11 (+3 Dex, +1 size)\n\nhp 5 (1d8+1)\n\nFort +3, Ref +5, Will +1   \nOffense   \nSpd 40 ft., climb 20 ft., swim 20 ft. \nMelee bite +1 (1d4 plus disease)\n\nSpecial Attacks disease   \nStatistics   \nStr 10, Dex 17, Con 13, Int 2, Wis 13, Cha 4 \nBase Atk +0; CMB -1; CMD 12 (16 vs. trip)\n\nFeats Skill Focus (Perception)\n\nSkills Climb +11, Perception +4, Stealth +11, Swim +11   \nEcology   \nEnvironment  any urban \nOrganization solitary or pack (2-20)\n\nTreasure none   \nSpecial abilities   \nDisease (Ex) Filth fever: Bite-injury; save Fort DC 11; onset 1d3 days; frequency 1/day; effect 1d3 Dex damage and 1d3 Con damage; cure 2 consecutive saves. The save DC is Constitution-based.   \nDescription\n\nDire rats grow up to 2 feet long and weigh up to 25 pounds. They are common menaces in dungeons and city sewers alike.\n\nDire Rat Companions Starting Statistics: Size Small; Speed 40 ft., climb 20 ft., swim 20 ft.; Attack bite (1d4); Ability Scores Str 10, Dex 17, Con 12, Int 2, Wis 12, Cha 4; Special Qualities lowlight vision, scent.\n\n4th-Level Advancement: Attack bite (1d4 plus disease); Ability Scores Str +2, Con +2.\n    </pre></div>"},"cr":{"base":0.33},"xp":{"value":0}},"skills":{"acr":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"apr":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"art":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"blf":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"clm":{"ability":"str","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"crf":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"dip":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"dev":{"ability":"dex","rt":true,"acp":true,"rank":0},"dis":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"esc":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"fly":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"han":{"ability":"cha","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"hea":{"ability":"wis","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"int":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kar":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kdu":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"ken":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kge":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"khi":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"klo":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kna":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kno":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kpl":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kre":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"lin":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"lor":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"per":{"ability":"wis","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"prf":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"pro":{"ability":"wis","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"rid":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"sen":{"ability":"wis","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"slt":{"ability":"dex","rt":true,"acp":true,"rank":0},"spl":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"ste":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":1},"s